    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are proud to present 47 Milltown Avenue, Mount St Anne's, Milltown, Dublin 6 to the open market, an exceptional four bedroom duplex apartment with a substantial attic conversion, extending to over 145 sq.m of beautifully appointed living space. Completely renovated and presented in immaculate turnkey condition, this outstanding home has been finished to an exacting standard throughout, combining contemporary design, generous proportions and an exceptional level of specification within one of Dublin 6's most prestigious residential developments.\n\nArranged over three spacious levels, the accommodation has been thoughtfully designed to provide an excellent balance of living, entertaining and bedroom space. The quality of the renovation is immediately apparent on entering, with stylish finishes, excellent natural light and meticulous attention to detail throughout.\n\nAt ground-floor level, the welcoming entrance hallway leads to a superb contemporary kitchen and dining area. The beautifully appointed kitchen features sleek high-gloss cabinetry, extensive storage, integrated appliances and a large quartz-topped island with breakfast-bar seating. The adjoining dining area provides ample space for a substantial dining table and benefits from full-height plantation shutters, creating a bright and sophisticated space ideal for both everyday family living and entertaining. A guest WC completes this level.\n\nTo the rear lies the particularly impressive living room, extending to approximately 5.51m x 4.22m. Generously proportioned and beautifully finished, this superb reception room features timber flooring, recessed lighting, bespoke full-height fitted bookcases and plantation shutters. Large glazed doors provide direct access to the generous south-west facing private balcony, which enjoys a pleasant leafy outlook and benefits from excellent afternoon and evening light, providing an ideal setting for outdoor dining and entertaining.\n\nThe first floor comprises four well-proportioned bedrooms, including two particularly generous double bedrooms. The principal bedroom benefits from its own contemporary en-suite, while a stylish family bathroom serves the remaining accommodation. The four-bedroom configuration provides considerable flexibility for families, guests and those requiring dedicated home-working space.\n\nThe accommodation continues to the second floor, where an impressive converted attic room measuring approximately 5.51m x 4.00m provides substantial additional space, ideally suited to use as a home office, family room, gym or recreational area.\n\nExternally, No. 47 has several features that further distinguish it from conventional apartment living. The property benefits from its own private front garden, two designated car parking spaces and a useful private storage shed beneath the front steps. Together with the substantial south-west facing balcony, these features give the property a level of private outdoor space, parking and storage rarely found in an apartment or duplex.\n\nThe property also benefits from a B-rated BER, complementing the extensive renovation and modern specification of the home.\n\nMount St Anne's enjoys an enviable setting in the heart of Milltown, one of Dublin 6's most sought-after residential locations. Milltown provides convenient shopping for everyday needs, while the neighbouring villages of Ranelagh, Donnybrook and Rathgar offer a superb selection of cafés, restaurants, boutiques and bars. Dundrum Town Centre is also within easy reach, together with an excellent choice of sporting, leisure and recreational amenities.\n\nA standout feature of Mount St Anne's is the private residents' access to Milltown Luas stop, providing exceptionally convenient connectivity to Dublin city centre, Dundrum and beyond.\n\nExtending to over 145 sq.m, with four bedrooms, substantial attic accommodation, a south-west facing balcony, private front garden, two parking spaces and excellent storage, 47 Milltown Avenue offers the proportions and practicality of a family home combined with the convenience and security of apartment living."
      },
